ex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px\">\n<a href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"VA Launchpad home\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; color: #F4F6F8; text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px\"><img src=\"a7540eee-5ad9-42da-8c0c-7ead1e5eb69f\" alt=\"VA Launchpad PH logo\" style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 28px; display: block\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.01em\">VA Launchpad.PH<\u002Fspan><\u002Fa>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 28px; font-size: 16px\">\n<a href=\"#curriculum\" style=\"color: #F4F6F8; text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center\">Curriculum<\u002Fa>\n<a href=\"#about\" style=\"color: #F4F6F8; text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center\">About<\u002Fa>\n<a href=\"#faq\" style=\"color: #F4F6F8; text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center\">FAQ<\u002Fa>\n<a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"background: {{accent}}; color: #0E2238; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; padding: 0 22px; min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; border-radius: 8px\">Enroll now<\u002Fa>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<div style=\"background: #0E2238; color: #F4F6F8\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 32px 96px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 56px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: {{accent}}\">Beginner course for aspiring virtual assistants<\u002Fdiv>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.02em\">Go from zero to a job-ready virtual assistant.<\u002Fh1>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 21px; color: #C9D5E2; max-width: 580px\">Build your profile, portfolio samples, and client pitch step by step, with the tools and AI skills clients now expect from a modern VA.<\u002Fp>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: center\">\n<a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"background: {{accent}}; color: #0E2238; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; padding: 0 32px; min-height: 56px; display: flex; align-items: center; border-radius: 10px\">Join VA Launchpad<\u002Fa>\n<a href=\"#curriculum\" style=\"color: #F4F6F8; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: underline; min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center\">See what's inside<\u002Fa>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; background: #17324F; border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">By the end, you'll have:<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; font-size: 17px; color: #E3EAF2\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"{{accent}}\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex: none; margin-top: 3px\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><div>A professional VA resume and online profile<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"{{accent}}\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex: none; margin-top: 3px\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><div>Three portfolio samples you can show clients<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"{{accent}}\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex: none; margin-top: 3px\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><div>A clear service menu and your starting rates<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"{{accent}}\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex: none; margin-top: 3px\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><div>A ready-to-send proposal template<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"{{accent}}\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex: none; margin-top: 3px\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><div>Onboarding, invoice, and weekly report templates<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px 24px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em\">Want to work from home, but not sure where to start?<\u002Fh2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #3F5167\">Most beginners get stuck on the same questions: What services can I actually offer? What do I charge? How do I get hired with no experience? VA Launchpad answers each one in order, with an action step after every lesson so you finish with real materials, not just notes.<\u002Fp>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px\">Complete beginners<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">You've never worked as a VA and want a clear path from learning to your first client.<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px\">Career changers<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">You have work experience in another field and want to turn it into flexible, remote income.<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px\">Parents and students<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">You need work that fits around your schedule and want practical skills you can use right away.<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<!-- CURRICULUM -->\n<div id=\"curriculum\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px 24px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3F5167\">The curriculum<\u002Fdiv>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em\">Six modules. One deliverable at the end of each.<\u002Fh2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #3F5167\">Short lessons, five to twelve minutes each. Learn one idea, do one action step, and move on.<\u002Fp>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px\">\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; color: #0E2238; background: {{accent}}; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">01<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">Foundations<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">What VAs really do, the 50+ services you can offer, whether this career fits you, and how your past experience transfers.<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E2238\">Deliverable: your skills inventory<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; color: #0E2238; background: {{accent}}; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">02<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">Setup<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">Your workspace and the core tools: Google Workspace, Slack, Zoom, Notion, task boards, and a daily routine that works.<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E2238\">Deliverable: organized workspace and sample task board<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; color: #0E2238; background: {{accent}}; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">03<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">Core skills<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">Email, calendars, data entry, research, document formatting, customer support basics, and keeping client data secure.<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E2238\">Deliverable: three portfolio samples<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; color: #0E2238; background: {{accent}}; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">04<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">Your offer<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">Choose your service or niche, package it, set rates you won't regret, and write a one-sentence pitch.<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E2238\">Deliverable: service menu, rates, and pitch<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; color: #0E2238; background: {{accent}}; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">05<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">Get hired<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">Resume, online profile, portfolio, finding real job postings, spotting scams, writing proposals, and acing interviews.<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E2238\">Deliverable: resume, profile, portfolio link, proposal template<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; color: #0E2238; background: {{accent}}; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center\">06<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">Work professionally<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"color: #3F5167; font-size: 17px\">Onboard clients, handle agreements, communicate clearly, invoice and get paid, and plan your first 30 days.<\u002Fdiv>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0E2238\">Deliverable: onboarding checklist, invoice and report templates<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<!-- BONUSES -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 32px 24px\">\n<div style=\"background: #0E2238; color: #F4F6F8; border-radius: 24px; padding: 56px 48px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; 